You may already know that there is a man named Croesus somwwhere in
the dungeon. Croesus is well known for his richdom. He has distributed
his treasures in many vaults on many levels in the dungeons. Of course,
he has also guards to control the vaults.
Therefore, when hear one of the above events, there is one of those
vaults hidden somewhere on that level.
In most (maybe all) cases, there will also be a teleport trap on that
level that moves you into the vault.
The rest is left to your surprise...   :-)

